housands of her followers lined up to cheer her motorcade as it made its wa=
y to the capital, Caracas. Some of her supporters said they cried when they=
 heard she was back.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,se=
rif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>The return of Machado, Venezuela=E2=
=80=99s most popular politician, now poses a dilemma for the Trump administ=
ration. It has promised to work toward elections in Venezuela, while instal=
ling as president one of the leading figures in Maduro=E2=80=99s repressive=
 administration. The question: How much does it really care about Venezuela=
n democracy=3F</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;co=
lor:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span style=3D"font-weight:700">Sidelined by Trum=
p</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;marg=
in:0 0 15px"><span>When the Trump administration toppled Maduro in a surpri=
