normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>She had bu=
ilt-in legitimacy with many Venezuelans. A charismatic politician, she rall=
ied millions to vote for her movement in the 2024 presidential election, an=
 election her candidate rightfully won, according to outside observers. Mad=
uro claimed victory anyway.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px geo=
rgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>She=E2=80=99d also gone out of=
